    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Scum_and_Villainy\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy\">Star Wars Saga Edition Scum and Villainy</a></i> </p><p>Highly Illegal and favored by shipjackers and pirates, a Lock Breaking Kit is like a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Tool_Kit\" title=\"Tool Kit\">Tool Kit</a> in many ways but has some very advanced and highly specialized tools. A Lock Breaking Kit grants the user a +5 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> bonus on all <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mechanics\" title=\"Mechanics\">Mechanics</a> and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_Computer\" title=\"Use Computer\">Use Computer</a> checks to bypass doors and airlocks on a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Starship\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Starship\">Starship</a>. </p>",
